        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 3,
          "text": "products sold with the Fairtrade mark in more than 140 countries."
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 4,
          "text": "Go to the previous fact"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 5,
          "text": "Go to the next fact"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 6,
          "text": "Good for people and planet"
        },
        {
          "role": "heading",
          "order": 7,
          "text": "Benefits of Fairtrade"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 8,
          "text": "Sustainable consumption and business have become the expectation rather than exceptions. Fairtrade offers solutions for companies and producers to put fairness at the heart of their operations."
        }
