      "items": [
        {
          "role": "heading",
          "order": 0,
          "text": "Fairtrade for your business"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 1,
          "text": "Whether you , Fairtrade offers ready solutions for companies of all sizes to ."
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 2,
          "text": "manufacture products, build a purpose-led brand or manage a retail portfolio"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 3,
          "text": "manage risks in their supply chains"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 4,
          "text": "The Fairtrade mark on your product shows that you are partnering with Fairtrade. It indicates that the product meets relevant criteria of the . The Fairtrade mark can help you build trust, differentiate your products and . Fairtrade partners with initiatives and campaigns."
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 5,
          "text": "Fairtrade standards and that, together with us, you are working to improve living and working conditions in producing countries"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 6,
          "text": "reach new target audiences"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 7,
          "text": "supports"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 8,
          "text": "marketing"
        }
      ],
