    {
      "section": "TextImage--wrapper",
      "items": [
        {
          "role": "heading",
          "order": 0,
          "text": "Why join Fairtrade?"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 1,
          "text": "Manage risk and strengthen supply chains"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 2,
          "text": "Long-Term business relationships"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 3,
          "text": "Trusted certification"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 4,
          "text": "Demonstrate credible impact"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 5,
          "text": "Stable business relationships with suppliers"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 6,
          "text": "Solutions for livable incomes"
        }
      ],
      "imgCount": 1,
      "editableTexts": 2,
      "repeats": []
    },
    {
      "section": "RichtextSection",
      "items": [
        {
          "role": "heading",
          "order": 0,
          "text": "Your path to the Fairtrade mark"
        },
        {
          "role": "heading",
          "order": 1,
          "text": "Contact and Consultation"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 2,
          "text": "During the initial consultation, we will get to know your company, supply chains, and requirements better. This allows us to provide you with the best possible support throughout the process of becoming a Fairtrade partner."
        },
        {
          "role": "cta",
          "order": 3,
          "text": "Contact us!",
          "href": "mailto:sales@fairtrade-deutschland.de"
        },
        {
          "role": "heading",
          "order": 4,
          "text": "Product certification"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 5,
          "text": "If you manufacture or package products yourself, an external audit is required. This applies up to the point in the supply chain where the products are fully packaged for consumers. The audit is conducted by , an external and independent certification body as required by law. FLOCERT verifies that retailers comply with Fairtrade standards."
        },
        {
          "role": "cta",
          "order": 6,
          "text": "FLOCERT",
          "href": "https://www.flocert.net/fairtrade-customer-search/"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 7,
          "text": "from a certified manufacturer, you do not need certification, but a ."
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 8,
          "text": "If you buy finished products in consumer ready packaging"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 9,
          "text": "license agreement"
        },
        {
          "role": "heading",
          "order": 10,
          "text": "License Agreement"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 11,
          "text": "Anyone who wishes to must have a license agreement with Fairtrade Germany."
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 12,
          "text": "sell products bearing the Fairtrade mark under its own brand or company name"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 13,
          "text": "The standardized license agreement ensures the of the Fairtrade mark. The agreement covers the following:"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 14,
          "text": "comparability, transparency, and credibility"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 15,
          "text": "to use the Fairtrade mark"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 16,
          "text": "Permission"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 17,
          "text": "that must be followed, including certification and product design requirements"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 18,
          "text": "Guidelines"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 19,
          "text": "License fees"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 20,
          "text": "If you manufacture private label products for retail or discount, please contact us. We will advise you on the applicable contractual set up."
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 21,
          "text": "Once the license agreement has been signed, you will become a Fairtrade partner."
        },
        {
          "role": "heading",
          "order": 22,
          "text": "Registration and approval of labelled products"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 23,
          "text": "All products bearing a Fairtrade Mark must be registered and approved in the online platform CONNECT. When the product has been approved in CONNECT, you can start selling and promoting your Fairtrade products."
        },
        {
          "role": "heading",
          "order": 24,
          "text": "Recognition and marketing"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 25,
          "text": "By using our mark, you can to Fairtrade and ."
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 26,
          "text": "communicate your commitment"
        },
        {
          "role": "body",
          "order": 27,
          "text": "build on the positive associations consumers have with the mark"
        }
      ],
